funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.stickerPack` to specify which sticker pack to use when transitioning into and out of a song.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - If the value isn't present, it will use the character's sticker pack instead.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.characters.opponentVocals` to specify which vocal track(s) to play for the opponent.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - If the value isn't present, it will use the `playData.characters.opponent`, but if it is present, it will be used (even if it's empty, in which case no vocals will be used for the opponent)
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.characters.playerVocals` to specify which vocal track(s) to play for the player.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - If the value isn't present, it will use the `playData.characters.player`, but if it is present, it will be used (even if it's empty, in which case no vocals will be used for the player)
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `offsets.altVocals` field to apply vocal offsets when alternate instrumentals are used.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `charter` field to denote authorship of a chart.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.previewStart` and `playData.previewEnd` fields to specify when in the song should the song's audio should be played as a preview in Freeplay.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.offsets` field to specify instrumental and vocal offsets.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.album` to specify the album art to display in Freeplay.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Added `playData.ratings` for difficulty ratings displayed in Freeplay.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Renamed `playData.noteSkin` to `playData.noteStyle`.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Rearranged the `playData` field.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Refactored the `playableChars`
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : - Removed the `variation` field.
funkin/data/song/CHANGELOG.md : 
