funkin/save/changelog.md : 
funkin/save/changelog.md : This version introduces changes to save data loading in order to improve compatibility with older versions.
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `optionsStageEditor.theme` converted from an Enum to a String to fix save data compatibility issues.
funkin/save/changelog.md : - In the future, Enum values should not be used in order to prevent incompatibilities caused by introducing new types to the save data that older versions cannot parse.
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `optionsChartEditor.theme` converted from an Enum to a String to fix save data compatibility issues.
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `optionsChartEditor.chartEditorLiveInputStyle` converted from an Enum to a String to fix save data compatibility issues.
funkin/save/changelog.md : 
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `optionsStageEditor` to `Save` for storing user preferences for the stage editor.
funkin/save/changelog.md : 
funkin/save/changelog.md : - Resolved an issue where HTML5 wouldn't store the semantic version properly, causing the game to fail to load the save.
funkin/save/changelog.md : 
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `unlocks.charactersSeen:Array<String>` to `Save`
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `unlocks.oldChar:Bool` to `Save`
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `favoriteSongs:Array<String>` to `Save`
funkin/save/changelog.md : 
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `inputOffset:Float` to `SongDataOptions`
funkin/save/changelog.md : - `audioVisualOffset:Float` to `SongDataOptions`
